    "Name": "Falcon FLC-6C",
    "Details": "Designed for the SLDF in the wake of the Reunification War, the Falcon is a Scout Mech hunter and an anti-infantry Mech. A 30 ton Light Mech, the Falcon is powered by a 180-rated Fusion Core. The Falcon FLC-6C is armed with an ER Large Laser and a pair of ER Small Lasers. A Targeting Computer enhances the Laser’s accuracy while AMS defends against incoming missiles.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
